    !>
    !> \f[
    !> \begin{array}{cl}
    !> A X = \lambda B X & \: \text{1st form,}\\
    !> A B X = \lambda X & \: \text{2nd form, or}\\
    !> B A X = \lambda X & \: \text{3rd form,}
    !> \end{array}
    !> \f]
    !>
    !> depending on the value of ``itype``. The eigenvectors are computed depending on the
