    !> If erange is rocblas_erange_index, nev = iu - il + 1. Otherwise, 0 <= nev <= n.
    !> @param[out]
    !> W           pointer to real type. Array on the GPU of dimension n.
    !> The first nev elements contain the computed eigenvalues. (The remaining elements
